# Implementation Plan — In-Place Premium Soft-UI Design Upgrades

This plan details the process of replacing the visual design of all classic screens *in-place*. Instead of changing route definitions, we will directly overwrite the widget layout and style code inside the original classic screen files with the modern Nunito Soft-Morphism style, layout, and behaviors of the new UI components.

This preserves the entire routing tree and all existing deep integrations, but instantly makes the entire application feel modern and premium.

---

